<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπ-τέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέφω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be fed, nurtured</i>,
			metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμναστικῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					403c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπτέον</span>
			<i>one must feed, keep</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				19a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢ ἐργαστέον ἢ ἀπὸ τῶν
				εἰργασμένων θρεπτέον</span>
			<i>one must live</i> on what has been earned, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				8.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
